Scope of this license

The MIT License above covers the source code of this project and the original
assets created for it (for example the code-drawn icons in assets/icons/, the
shaders, the procedural maps, outfits and effects, and the documentation),
unless a file or folder says otherwise.

It does NOT cover:

- Third-party assets in assets/ (character models, animations, sounds, music,
  fonts and other packs). Each keeps its own license (CC0, CC BY, SIL OFL,
  VRoid Hub license, ...), listed with attributions in assets/CREDITS.md and
  with full texts in assets/licenses/.
- Third-party code in addons/ (GodotSteam, MIT, see addons/godotsteam/) and
  the Godot Engine itself (MIT, see the Godot license notices).
- The Glory (荣耀) / 全职高手 / The King's Avatar names, characters and setting.
  This is an unofficial fan project; those rights belong to their owners and
  are not licensed by this repository.
